@startuml Project01_State_Reproduction
title Butterfly — reproduction states

[*] --> Wandering

Wandering --> LookingForPartner : ready to reproduce
LookingForPartner --> Wandering : no partner nearby
LookingForPartner --> PartnerFound : partner nearby

PartnerFound --> MixingColors : both parents\npass on a color
MixingColors --> BabyBorn : colors combined\ninto a new color
BabyBorn --> Wandering : back to normal life

Wandering : flying around,\nnot reproducing right now
LookingForPartner : trying to find\nanother butterfly nearby
PartnerFound : a partner\nhas been found
MixingColors : each parent gives\none of its colors
BabyBorn : a new butterfly\nis created nearby

@enduml
